OL,3,GNEWSANew traffic measures after gas
OL,4,Aworks disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FChanges have been made to road traffic
OL,7,Fmanagement after reports of long
OL,8,Fdelays.
OL,10,FTorbay Council said measures were put
OL,11,Fin place on Wednesday after delays
OL,12,Fcaused by gas works in Dartmouth Road,
OL,13,FGalmpton on Monday.
OL,15,FIt said highways engineers visited the
OL,16,Fsite and instructed contractors from
OL,17,FWales and West Utilities (WWU) to make
OL,18,Fchanges including reducing the length
OL,19,Fof the works area and ensuring signals
OL,20,Fare operated manually from 06:30 to
OL,21,F20:00 BST from Monday to Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
